{"title":"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eDiscover Our Most Realistic Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAt King of Christmas, our collection of premium artificial Christmas trees is designed for those seeking the most realistic and beautifully crafted artificial Christmas trees for their holiday display. Each tree features lifelike branch tips, rich evergreen color variation, and carefully shaped silhouettes that closely resemble natural evergreens.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you prefer pre-lit artificial Christmas trees with professionally installed micro LED lights or unlit styles that allow you to decorate with your own lighting and ornaments, our premium collection offers stunning options to suit any holiday décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat are premium artificial Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur most realistic premium artificial Christmas trees are crafted using PE and PVC branch tip blends, creating a fuller and more natural appearance that is perfect for those transitioning from a real tree to an artificial Christmas tree. Premium artificial Christmas trees typically feature a higher percentage of realistic branch tips compared to standard \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/realistic-trees\" title=\"Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003erealistic artificial trees\u003c\/a\u003e, resulting in more lifelike detail. Available in sizes up to 12 feet, our premium trees include both green and flocked designs, allowing you to create anything from a traditional holiday display to a magical winter display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWith exceptional craftsmanship, realistic foliage, and timeless style, King of Christmas premium artificial Christmas trees are designed to become a lasting centerpiece of your holiday traditions. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a premium artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePremium artificial Christmas trees are designed to deliver a higher level of realism, fullness, and craftsmanship compared to standard trees. With a greater percentage of molded PE branch tips and carefully layered foliage, these trees closely mimic the structure and texture of real evergreen branches.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWith durable construction and lifelike foliage that holds its shape season after season, a premium artificial Christmas tree is an investment in many years of beautiful holiday memories. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat sizes do premium artificial Christmas trees come in?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas offers premium artificial Christmas trees in a variety of heights to suit different spaces, typically ranging from 6.5 to 12 feet. Whether you're decorating a cozy living room or a grand entryway, our collection includes both full and slim options designed to complement your space.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat lighting options are available on premium artificial Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eMany premium artificial Christmas trees feature advanced lighting technology designed to create a stunning holiday display. At King of Christmas, select premium trees include professionally installed LED lights with multiple lighting modes, allowing you to easily switch between different lighting effects.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eSome of our most realistic artificial Christmas trees feature multi-mode lighting technology, allowing you to switch between warm white lights and multicolor lights on the same tree with the touch of a button. This feature is available on popular styles such as the \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\"\u003eRoyal Fir\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/cypress-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\"\u003eCypress Spruce\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, giving you the flexibility to change your holiday look from classic warm white to festive multi-color.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur newest premium design, the \u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Silverpeak Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/silverpeak-fir\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSilverpeak Fir\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, features clustered twinkle micro LED lights with up to 10 lighting modes, including slow twinkle and pastel multicolor lighting effects. The densely placed fairy lights create a fuller sparkle throughout the branches, making it a stunning and enchanting holiday centerpiece.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you’re looking for the most realistic artificial Christmas tree or a beautifully crafted centerpiece for your holiday décor, premium artificial Christmas trees offer unmatched realism, quality, and timeless appeal. Explore our collection to find a tree that brings elegance and lasting beauty to your home year after year.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 850 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642923741248,"sku":"RF-T6.5-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_20f68d8d-c632-40c6-9197-a0d56de53b1b.png?v=1722013184"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642924003392,"sku":"RF-T7.5-U","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-8.jpg?v=1718158803"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642924134464,"sku":"RF-T7.5-L","price":1199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_187ca423-b95a-4973-81ad-b9b24bddb079.png?v=1722013181"},{"product_id":"9-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1200 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642924429376,"sku":"RF-T9-L","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_3795bea1-b24d-43e1-8cc9-89c11c4dcfc5.png?v=1722013200"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Chri