d by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28997011046464,"sku":"RF-T10-L","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_59c675e2-b8a7-4062-af58-098f2e9b8021.png?v=1722013217"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":29211291058240,"sku":"KFFS-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFraserFirSlim.jpg?v=1786731058"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"9' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 900 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","b